Who Can’t Afford Unreliable Logistics</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="55F617BF" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="008E286F" w:rsidRPr="008E286F" w:rsidRDefault="008E286F" w:rsidP="008E286F"><w:r w:rsidRPr="008E286F"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Section Description</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="008E286F"><w:br/><w:t>Quick Box is designed for businesses that have outgrown informal delivery solutions and need a structured, professional logistics partner they can trust with inventory, customer experience, and cash flow.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="5CF9D4E6" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="008E286F" w:rsidRPr="008E286F" w:rsidRDefault="008E286F" w:rsidP="008E286F"><w:r w:rsidRPr="008E286F"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Audience Cards / Descriptions</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="77696593" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="008E286F" w:rsidRPr="008E286F" w:rsidRDefault="008E286F" w:rsidP="008E286F"><w:pPr><w:numPr><w:ilvl w:val="0"/><w:numId w:val="1"/></w:numPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="008E286F"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>E-Commerce Sellers Handling Daily Orders</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="008E286F"><w:br/><w:t>Businesses processing consistent order volumes that need reliable fulfillment without hiring internal logistics teams.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="216AB96E" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="008E286F" w:rsidRPr="008E286F" w:rsidRDefault="008E286F" w:rsidP="008E286F"><w:pPr><w:numPr><w:ilvl w:val="0"/><w:numId w:val="1"/></w:numPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="008E286F"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Instagram &amp; WhatsApp Businesses Scaling Fast</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="008E286F"><w:br/><w:t>Social commerce sellers who want to focus on marketing and sales while logistics, deliveries, and COD are handled professionally.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="165882B6" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="008E286F" w:rsidRPr="008E286F" w:rsidRDefault="008E286F" w:rsidP="008E286F"><w:pPr><w:numPr><w:ilvl w:val="0"/><w:numId w:val="1"/></w:numPr></w:pPr><w:r w: